OL,3,GNEWSAPrison report highlights violence,
OL,4,Adrugs and rats
OL,5,
OL,6,FA prison has recorded more violence,
OL,7,Fdrug use and rat infestations as
OL,8,Foperational pressures, including staff
OL,9,Fshortages, continue.
OL,11,FAn Independent Monitoring Board (IMB)
OL,12,Fnoted a number of concerns at Rutland's
OL,13,FStocken Prison in a report, covering a
OL,14,F12-month period between May 2025 and
OL,15,FApril 2026.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
