OL,3,GNEWSAPrison report highlights violence,
OL,4,Adrugs and rats
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe report said the category C prison
OL,7,Falso suffered from an "ineffective"
OL,8,Fsewage arrangement and malfunctioning
OL,9,Fheating and hot water systems - issues
OL,10,Fwhich have "presented challenges to the
OL,11,Fstaff and have negatively impacted
OL,12,Fprisoners".
OL,14,FHowever, the IMB found Stocken Prison
OL,15,Fto be a "generally safe place for both
OL,16,Fprisoners and staff".
